'''Tikaroo''' was a [[City|town]] located on the [[planet]] [[Devaron]]. The town was composed of a few small stilt houses, most of which were one or two stories tall. Tikaroo was surrounded by [[jungle]].<ref name="Weapon 2">{{StoryCite|story=The Weapon of a Jedi, Part 2|book=Star Wars Magazine 20}}</ref> [[Luke Skywalker]] landed in Tikaroo after his [[BTL-A4 Y-wing assault starfighter/bomber]] was damaged, and from there he headed for the [[Jedi]] [[Temple of Eedit]].<ref name="Weapon of a Jedi" />

